<title>USA: Atchison Casting buys Beloit foundry unit.</title>
<headline>Atchison Casting buys Beloit foundry unit.</headline>
<dateline>ATCHISON, Kan. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atchison Casting Corp said it purchased the Beloit Castings Division, the foundry division of Beloit Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed. In a release dated July 2, the company said 12-month revenues for the division were about $31 million.</p>
<p>Beloit Corp is a subsidiary of Harnischfeger Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Atchison produces iron, steel and non-ferrous castings.</p>
<p>	  ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
